Theoretical data from: Tachiev G. I., Froese Fischer C., 2002, A&A, 385, 716,
 supplemented by data from ATSP2K and Autostructure calculations produced for 
 Dufresne, R.P., Del Zanna, G., Storey, P.J., 2021, MNRAS, 505, 3968

 Autostructure included level energy corrections based on NIST for all levels
 except 36. Correcting the last level affected A-values adversely.
 
 Used gf and A values for 36 -> 1,2,3,4,5 from AS because they better match Sandlin et al (1986) observed intensity ratios.

